{"id":"6d960190ab4c3bcf","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Specialization Preorder","display":"df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder — ZFC Topo11 Specialization Preorder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder — ZFC Topo11 Specialization Preorder","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder — ZFC Topo11 Specialization Preorder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,R\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SpecializationPreorder}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SpecializationPreorder}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}specialization\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SpecializationPreorder}_S(R,X,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to y\\in U)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}specialization\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SpecializationPreorder}_S(R,X,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to y\\in U)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relation is reflexive and transitive for every topology; the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span> axiom is needed only when antisymmetry is desired.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SpecializationPreorder}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}specialization\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SpecializationPreorder}_S(R,X,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to y\\in U)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_0","display":false}],"bytes":1334,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3694","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder.md|58-df-zfc-topo11-specialization-preorder]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","41276343f41b253b"]}